casein gene expression and of a cytosolic 120-kd protein in a cloned mouse mammary epithelial cell line</article-title><source>EMBO J</source><year>1988</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>2089</fpage><lpage>2095</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3416834</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Humphreys</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosen</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Stably transfected HC11 cells provide an in vitro and in vivo model system for studying Wnt gene function</article-title><source>Cell Growth Differ</source><year>1997</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>839</fpage><lpage>849</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9269893</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Desrivi&#x000e8;res</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Prinz</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Castro-Palomino Laria</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Meyer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Boehm</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Bauer</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Schafer</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Neumann</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Shemanko</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Groner</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparative proteomic analysis of proliferating and functionally differentiated mammary epithelial cells</article-title><source>Mol Cell Proteomics</source><year>2003</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>1039</fpage><lpage>1054</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12885951</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1074/mcp.M300032-MCP200</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation cit